#. Tag: title
#: man-ark.1.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descrición"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; is a program for managing various archive formats within the "
"&kde; environment. Archives can be viewed, extracted, created and modified "
"from within &kappname;. The program can handle various formats such as "
"<application>tar</application>, <application>gzip</application>, "
"<application>bzip2</application>, <application>zip</application>, "
"<application>rar</application> and <application>lha</application> (if "
"appropriate command-line programs are installed). &kappname; can work "
"closely with &konqueror; in the &kde; environment to handle archives, if you "
"install the &konqueror; Integration plugin available in the kdeaddons "
"package."
msgstr ""
"O &kappname; é un programa para xestionar diversos formatos de arquivos no "
"ambiente do &kde;. Pódense ver, extraer, crear e modificar os arquivos dentro do &kappname;. O programa pode tratar diversos formatos, como o "
"<application>tar</application>, o <application>gzip</application>, o "
"<application>bzip2</application>, o <application>zip</application>, o "
"<application>rar</application> e o <application>lha</application> (se "
"estiveren instalados os programas da liña de comandos apropiados). O "
"&kappname; pode funcionar de perto co &konqueror; no ambiente do &kde; para "
"tratar os arquivos, se se instala a extensión de integración co &konqueror; "
"que ven no paquete \"'kdeaddons\"."

#. Tag: title
#: man-ark.1.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Opcións"

#. Tag: option
#: man-ark.1.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "--extract"
msgstr "--extract"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "Open extract dialog, quit when finished"
msgstr "Abrir o diálogo de extracción e sair ao rematar"

#. Tag: option
#: man-ark.1.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"--extract-to <replaceable>folder</replaceable> <replaceable>archive</"
"replaceable>"
msgstr ""
"--extract-to <replaceable>cartafol</replaceable> <replaceable>arquivo</"
"replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Extract <replaceable>archive</replaceable> to <replaceable>folder</"
"replaceable>. Quit when finished. <replaceable>folder</replaceable> will be "
"created if it does not exist."
msgstr ""
"Extraer o <replaceable>arquivo</replaceable> para o <replaceable>cartafol</"
"replaceable>. Sair ao terminar. Crearase <replaceable>cartafol</replaceable> "
"se este non existe."

#. Tag: option
#: man-ark.1.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "--add <replaceable>files</replaceable>"
msgstr "--add <replaceable>ficheiros</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ask for the name of the archive to add <replaceable>files</replaceable> to. "
"Quit when finished."
msgstr ""
"Preguntar o nome do arquivo ao cal engadir os <replaceable>ficheiros</"
"replaceable>. Sair ao terminar."

#. Tag: option
#: man-ark.1.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"--add-to <replaceable>files</replaceable> <replaceable>archive</replaceable>"
msgstr ""
"--add-to <replaceable>ficheiros</replaceable> <replaceable>arquivo</"
"replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Add <replaceable>files</replaceable> to <replaceable>archive</replaceable>. "
"Quit when finished. <replaceable>archive</replaceable> will be created if it "
"does not exist."
msgstr ""
"Engadir os <replaceable>ficheiros</replaceable> ao <replaceable>arquivo</"
"replaceable>. Sair ao terminar. Crearase o <replaceable>arquivo</"
"replaceable> se este non existe."

#. Tag: option
#: man-ark.1.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"--guess-name <replaceable>folder</replaceable> <replaceable>archive</"
"replaceable>"
msgstr ""
"--guess-name <replaceable>cartafol</replaceable> <replaceable>arquivo</"
"replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Used with <option>--extract-to</option>. When specified, "
"<replaceable>archive</replaceable> will be extracted to a subfolder of "
"<replaceable>folder</replaceable> whose name will be the name of "
"<replaceable>archive without the filename extension.</replaceable>"
msgstr "Úsase con <option>--extract-to</option>. Cando for indicado, o  <replaceable>arquivo</replaceable> extráese para un subcartafol do  <replaceable>cartafol</replaceable>, cuxo nome é o nome do  <replaceable>arquivo sen a extensión do ficheiro.</replaceable>"

#. Tag: title
#: man-ark.1.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "Ambiente"

#. Tag: term
#: man-ark.1.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "$<envar>PATH</envar>"
msgstr "$<envar>PATH</envar>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The commandline programs to deal with the archives you wish to handle in "
"&kappname; must be available in your $<envar>PATH</envar>."
msgstr ""
"Os programas da liña de comandos que operen sobre os arquivos que se queiran "
"tratar co &kappname; han de estar disponíbeis en $<envar>PATH</envar>."

#. Tag: title
#: man-ark.1.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Exemplos"

#. Tag: userinput
#: man-ark.1.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>ark</command> <option>--extract-to --guess-name</option> "
"<parameter>.</parameter> <parameter>An-Archive.tar.bz2</parameter>"
msgstr ""
"<command>ark</command> <option>--extract-to --guess-name</option> "
"<parameter>.</parameter> <parameter>Un-Arquivo.tar.bz2</parameter>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Will extract <filename>An-Archive.tar.bz2</filename> into a folder named "
"<filename class=\"directory\">An-Archive</filename> in the current directory."
msgstr ""
"Extrae <filename>Un-Arquivo.tar.bz2</filename> para un cartafol "
"chamado<filename class=\"directory\">Un-Arquivo</filename> no cartafol "
"actual."

#. Tag: userinput
#: man-ark.1.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>ark</command> <option>--add-to</option> <filename>*.jpg</filename> "
"<filename>pictures.tar.bz2</filename>"
msgstr ""
"<command>ark</command> <option>--add-to</option> <filename>*.jpg</filename> "
"<filename>imaxes.tar.bz2</filename>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Add all files ending in *.jpg to an archive named <filename>pictures.tar."
"bz2</filename>, creating it if it doesn't already exist."
msgstr ""
"Engade todos os ficheiros que terminen en *.jpg a un arquivo chamado "
"<filename>imaxes.tar.bz2</filename>, creándoo se este non existise xa."

